# UniFi Network MCP

Go MCP server for UniFi Network Controllers.

Cursor uses `.cursor/rules/` (this file + org common). Copilot instructions under `.github/` remain for other tools.

## Conventions

- Prefer env / `.env.example` for controller URL and API keys
- Keep tool handlers thin; share client code for UniFi API calls
- Do not commit live credentials or site-specific secrets
